{"id":"word:hebrew:H2734","type":"word","title":"חָרָה","subtitle":"H2734 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to glow or grow warm ; figuratively (usually) to blaze up , of anger, zeal, jealousy","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָרָה (H2734) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 90 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָרָה (chârâh) means to glow or grow warm ; figuratively (usually) to blaze up , of anger, zeal, jealousy First listed occurrence: 1Chr 13 10."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָרָה","transliteration":"chârâh","pronunciation":"khaw-raw'","strong":"H2734","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2734","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּֽחַר","וַ/יִּ֥חַר","וַ/יִּ֣חַר","חָרָ֣ה","חָ֥רָה"],"morphs":[["HC/Vqw3ms",47],["HVqp3ms",16],["HVqj3ms",7],["HC/Vqq3ms",4],["HVtj2ms",4],["HVqi3ms",3],["HR/Vqc",2],["HTd/VNrmpa",2],["HVqa",1],["HC/Vqp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to glow or grow warm ; figuratively (usually) to blaze up , of anger, zeal, jealousy","usage":"be angry, burn, be displeased, × earnestly, fret self, grieve, be (wax) hot, be incensed, kindle, × very, be wroth. See 8474 .","full":"H2734. charah חָרָה verb burn, be kindled , of anger (Aramaic חרי Pa`el cause , fire to burn (rare); Zinjirli חרא anger , Nö ZMG 1893, 98. 103 ; Arabic burning sensation, in throat , etc., from rage and pain ) — Qal Perfect ׳ח Gen 4:6 20 t.; Imperfect יֶחֱרֶה Exod 32:11 2 t.; יִ֫חַר Gen 18:30 7 t.; וַיִּ֫חַר 4:5 46t.; Infinitive absolute חָרֹה 1Sam 20:7 ; construct חֲרוֺת 2Sam 24:1 ; Psa 124:3 ; &#8212; 1 of man : a. אף חרה (one's) anger was kindled, burned Gen 39:19 ; Num 22:27 (J), Exod 32:19 , 22 (JE), Judg 9:30 ; 14:19 ; 1Sam 11:6 ; Job 32:2 , 5 ; with בְּ against Gen 30:2 (E), 44:18 (J), 1Sam 17:28 ; 20:30 ; 2Sam 12:5 ; 2Chr 25:10 ; Psa 124:3 ; Job 32:2-3 , with אֶל Num 24:10 (E). b. impersonal, אף omitted; לְ חרה it was kindled for (him) he burned with anger Gen 31:36 (E), 4:5-6 , 34:7 ; Num 16:15 (J), 1Sam 15:11 (read perhaps וַיֵּצֶר , Weir in Dr), 18:8 ; 20:7 (twice in verse); 2Sam 3:8 ; 6:8 = 1Chr 13:11 ; 2Sam 13:21 ; 19:43 ; Nehemiah 3:33; Neh 4:1 ; 5:6 ; Jonah 4:1 , 4 , 9 (twice in verse); insert לדוד ויחר 2Sam 11:22 ᵐ5 We Dr; ׳ח בְּעֵינֵי Gen 31:35 ; 45:5 (E). 2 of God : a. ׳ח אף Exod 22:23 ; Num 22:22 (E), 11:1 , 10 ; 32:10 (J); with בְּ Exod 4:14 ; 32:10 ; Num 12:9 ; Deut 31:17 (J), 6:15 ; 7:4 ; 11:17 ; 29:26 ; Josh 23:16 (D), Judg 6:39 ; 2Sam 6:7 = 1Chr 13:10 ; Hosea 8:5 ; 2Kin 23:26 ; 2Chr 25:15 ; Job 42:7 ; בְּעַם Exod 32:11 ; Num 11:33 (J), Isa 5:25 ; Psa 106:40 ; בישׂראל Num 25:3 ; 32:13 (JE); Judg 2:14 , 20 ; 3:8 ; 10:7 ; 2Sam 24:1 ; 2Kin 13:3 ; ישׂראל בבני Josh 7:1 (R); אף בנהרים, omitted, Hab 3:8 ; with עַל Zech 10:3 . b. לְ חרה Gen 18:30 , 32 (J) 2Sam 22:8 = Psa 18:8 . &#8212; Note: חרה not in HP (who use קצף ); nor in Jeremiah, Ezekiel, Isa 2 , Proverbs or poetry of Job. Niph`al Perfect נִחֲרוּֿ followed by בְּ Song 1:6 (according to Bö ii. 379 De Kö 1. 551 ) be angry with; Participle בְּ הַנֶּחֱרִים ׳כֹּל all that are incensed against (thee) Isa 41:11 , so 45:24 . Hiph`il Perfect הֶחֱזִיק הֶחֱרָה Neh 3:20 burned with zeal (?) in repairing , but ᵐ5 omit החרה ; probably dittograph; Imperfect אַמּוֺ עָלַי וַיַּחַר Job 19:11 and kindled his anger against me . Hithpa`el Imperfect תִּתְחַר אַל Psa 37:1 ; 37:7 ; 37:8 ; Prov 24:19 heat oneself in vexation . — The following forms are somewhat dubious: Imperfect 2masculine singular אֶתהַֿסּוּסִים תְּתַחֲרֶה אֵיךְ Jer 12:5 how canst thou hotly contend (in a race) with the horses ? Participle בָאָ֑רֶז מְתַחֲרֶה אַתָּה כִּי 22:15 because thou strivest eagerly (to excel) in cedar ; explained as Tiph`el by Thes Ges § 55 , 5 Ew § 122 a Ol § 255 a Sta § 159 b Kö i. p. 557 and others, and regarded by most as a rare causative stem; but ag. existence of Tiph`el see Ba NB § 180 a; ZMG 1894, 20 ; Ba regards the form as denominative (from a noun formed by ת preform., compare Aramaic contention ); SS would point as Hithpa`el [compare Syriac contend with , contention ], although meaning of Hithpa`el is different, see above","rootNote":"a primitive root (compare 2787 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 10","1Chr 13 11","1Sam 11 6","1Sam 15 11","1Sam 17 28","1Sam 18 8","1Sam 20 7","1Sam 20 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":90,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּֽחַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 13 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּ֣חַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּ֥חַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 15 11","book":"1Sam","chapter":15,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּ֨חַר֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 28","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּֽחַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּ֨חַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 7","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָרֹ֤ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqa"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 7","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יֶֽחֱרֶה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּֽחַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 25 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":25,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּ֨חַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"r